e optimal play. Both players have shown weakness by checking all streets. Betting risks turning my hand into a bluff against better pairs or draws that will call. Checking allows me to see the river card cheaply and reassess. Given my overall chip lead, there's no need to take unnecessary risks with a marginal hand.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
